# Pairs with StableNoDuplicate. The split reaches a stable phase with duplicate rows.
MODULE: FinishSplitKeepsDonorCopies
TARGET: StableNoDuplicate
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a completed split leaves keys on both leaves
PERTURBS: FinishSplit

--- FIND
FinishSplit ==
    /\ phase = "splitting"
    /\ born
    /\ donorNext
    /\ siblingPrev
    /\ successorPrev
    /\ donorRows \cap Moving = {}
    /\ phase' = "ready"
    /\ donorRows' = donorRows
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: retain all moved rows on the donor.
FinishSplit ==
    /\ phase = "splitting"
    /\ born
    /\ donorNext
    /\ siblingPrev
    /\ successorPrev
    /\ donorRows \cap Moving = {}
    /\ phase' = "ready"
    /\ donorRows' = donorRows \cup siblingRows
--- END
